    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17076" root="روض" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرُوضٌ</span></b> , (S, K,) and its fem., with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, (S, Msb,)
A colt, (S, K,) and she-camel, (S,) or beast
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَابَّة</span>), (Msb,) <i>broken,</i> or <i>trained.</i> (S * Msb, K.)
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَيِّضٌ</span>.

